---
date: 2026-07-29T23:41:12-04:00
---

Pyre is a massive wooden stake, and the charred, smoldering remains of a creature affixed to it. The body is long since charred beyond all recognition, and yet something in that charcoal mass still registers deep in its viewer’s reptilian brains as pure hatred. Black and red fluids seep from cracks in the body, evaporating into a cloud of miasma upon exposure to the air. Despite its advanced state of cremation, the body shakes occasionally, but whether writhing in pain or anger is impossible to tell.
